%%report knowledge-article-age-bands title: How recently knowledge articles were changed entity: KnowledgeArticle chart: bar x: last_changed y: records help: Maintain a governed knowledge article record for the customer lifecycle; retain its history and verify ownership before changing business-critical values. Records by time since their last change; the oldest band is the stale tail to review or retire. sql: SELECT CASE WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '30 days' THEN 'last 30 days' WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '90 days' THEN '30 to 90 days' WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '180 days' THEN '90 to 180 days' ELSE 'older than 180 days' END AS last_changed, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_knowledge_article WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY MIN(updated_at) DESC
%%report knowledge-article-published-at-per-month title: Knowledge Articles by published at entity: KnowledgeArticle chart: line x: month y: records help: Maintain a governed knowledge article record for the customer lifecycle; retain its history and verify ownership before changing business-critical values. Knowledge Articles grouped by the month of published at, looking two years back and one ahead. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', published_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_knowledge_article WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND published_at IS NOT NULL AND published_at >= now() - interval '24 months' AND published_at < now() + interval '12 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report knowledge-article-top-language title: Knowledge Articles: the most common language entity: KnowledgeArticle chart: bar x: language y: records help: Maintain a governed knowledge article record for the customer lifecycle; retain its history and verify ownership before changing business-critical values. The ten most frequent values of language among knowledge articles; free text that repeats is a list the model could close. sql: SELECT COALESCE(language, '(blank)') AS language, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_knowledge_article WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
%%report knowledge-article-completeness title: How complete knowledge articles are entity: KnowledgeArticle chart: bar x: field y: missing help: Maintain a governed knowledge article record for the customer lifecycle; retain its history and verify ownership before changing business-critical values. For each optional field, how many knowledge articles leave it empty; the long bars are the fields nobody fills in. sql: SELECT 'owner' AS field, COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE owner_id IS NULL) AS missing FROM bus_knowledge_article WHERE deleted_at IS NULL UNION ALL SELECT 'published at', COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE published_at IS NULL) FROM bus_knowledge_article WHERE deleted_at IS NULL ORDER BY 2 DESC
