%%report service-appointment-lifecycle title: Service Appointment lifecycle entity: ServiceAppointment chart: bar x: state y: records help: Maintain a governed service appointment record for the customer lifecycle; retain its history and verify ownership before changing business-critical values. Where service appointments sit in their state machine, in the order the diagram draws it; a state nothing has reached shows as zero. sql: SELECT d.state, COALESCE(c.records, 0) AS records FROM (SELECT 'requested' AS state, 0 AS position UNION ALL SELECT 'confirmed', 1 UNION ALL SELECT 'dispatched', 2 UNION ALL SELECT 'completed', 3 UNION ALL SELECT 'cancelled', 4) d LEFT JOIN (SELECT status AS state, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_service_appointment WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1) c ON c.state = d.state ORDER BY d.position
