%%report survey-response-score-per-customer-survey title: Total score per customer survey entity: SurveyResponse chart: bar x: customer_survey y: total_score help: Maintain a governed survey response record for the customer lifecycle; retain its history and verify ownership before changing business-critical values. Survey Responses added up on score for each customer survey, ten largest first. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS customer_survey, ROUND(SUM(x.score)::numeric, 2) AS total_score FROM bus_survey_response x LEFT JOIN bus_customer_survey p ON p.id = x.customer_survey_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST LIMIT 10
