%%report legal-hold-created-per-month title: Legal Holds created per month entity: LegalHold chart: line x: month y: records help: Maintain a governed legal hold record for the customer lifecycle; retain its history and verify ownership before changing business-critical values. New legal holds per month over two years - the volume the business actually handles. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_legal_hold WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report legal-hold-initiated-at-per-month title: Legal Holds by initiated at entity: LegalHold chart: line x: month y: records help: Maintain a governed legal hold record for the customer lifecycle; retain its history and verify ownership before changing business-critical values. Legal Holds grouped by the month of initiated at, looking two years back and one ahead. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', initiated_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_legal_hold WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND initiated_at IS NOT NULL AND initiated_at >= now() - interval '24 months' AND initiated_at < now() + interval '12 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report legal-hold-released-at-per-month title: Legal Holds by released at entity: LegalHold chart: line x: month y: records help: Maintain a governed legal hold record for the customer lifecycle; retain its history and verify ownership before changing business-critical values. Legal Holds grouped by the month of released at, looking two years back and one ahead. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', released_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_legal_hold WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND released_at IS NOT NULL AND released_at >= now() - interval '24 months' AND released_at < now() + interval '12 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
